  "cooked": "<p>While looking at a peer-observer dashboard for time spent in the b-msghand (P2P message handling thread) of Bitcoin Core, I noticed that some of the nodes (especially dave with many connections) were active in that thread for more than 500-700ms per second (i.e 50% - 70%) on e.g. 2025-11-17.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15_2_690x431.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iIibiaEERiw8L6Z6BI9f8QbFzpj\" width=\"690\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15_2_690x431.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15_2_1035x646.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/8328e713e628283d9c26e3a5a530ad329d7c4f15.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"5C6D47\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1086\u00d7679 77.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The host frank doesn\u2019t have a mempool. Since he\u2019s not affected, this indicates this could be related to transaction relay and processing.</p>\n<p>Looking deeper into this, it revealed many transactions getting added to the mempool at that time (&gt;2000 on some nodes per minute)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd_2_690x429.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jftyHZ2BO5SZSkGQK07ywG4WjdX\" width=\"690\" height=\"429\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd_2_690x429.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd_2_1035x643.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/86e92d3ca08a90b574a5f85e182db98c65c945dd.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2D6A41\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1080\u00d7673 66.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>as well as a lot of tx/wtx INVs per minute sent to peers</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe_2_690x433.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1ZvyS3GhnLAI7llJPo7V3KBRhiS\" width=\"690\" height=\"433\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe_2_690x433.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe_2_1035x649.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/0df6242d32fc94f287322d21ec3a6d696e9f9cfe.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"255A39\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1073\u00d7674 72.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and a lot (&gt;200k per minute) of transactions getting sent via <code>tx</code> messages.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57_2_690x425.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kxTjKSlKeSIgdoCUnE0jU5JReS3\" width=\"690\" height=\"425\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57_2_690x425.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57_2_1035x637.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/900043426f3df6cf150098ce70475a337f02db57.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"195033\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1079\u00d7665 64.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Many of these transactions had 352 bytes. One of them is: <a href=\"https://mempool.space/tx/8dbb01c978ae4126339f7fb538068afbda194b65f3b1f71fca1f5833b7fbdc91\">https://mempool.space/tx/8dbb01c978ae4126339f7fb538068afbda194b65f3b1f71fca1f5833b7fbdc91</a></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a_2_690x151.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cuLAcuAymB2hLvq3lJPLPu003fY\" width=\"690\" height=\"151\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a_2_690x151.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a_2_1035x226.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/5794722952f5cb51e513b1cd14c8836e4845cf6a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"22283D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1146\u00d7252 23.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
